### 3.2  Storing the API key safely

Create a **`.env`** file (never commit it) in the project root:

```
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
```

Load it automatically by adding at the top of `app.py`:

