## 6. Extending / Productionizing

| Feature | How to add |
|---------|------------|
| **User accounts & saved projects** | Add Flask‑Login, DB tables for outlines/chapters, and load them on page init. |
| **Multiple language support** | Pass `language` as a variable and adapt prompts accordingly. |
| **Streaming responses** | Use `openai.ChatCompletion.create(..., stream=True)` and push chunks to the client via Server‑Sent Events (SSE) for a “typing” effect. |
