Proceeding inductively, after the last iteration we obtain an optimal
solution that uses precisely the same set of stations as the algorithm.
Consequently both have the same total time, which is therefore minimal. ∎



##### Lemma 5  
If the algorithm stops because the heap is empty, the reported
