| Feature | What you see | Why it matters |
|---------|--------------|----------------|
| **`sem_wait` blocks** | Process 2 cannot acquire semaphore 1 while Process 1 holds it. | Demonstrates classic *mutual exclusion* – an attacker can lock a resource and induce a denial‑of‑service. |
