* a 512‑bit HMAC‑SHA‑512 key (64 bytes)  

The code uses the **EVP_KDF** API that ships with OpenSSL 3.x (the same API works with OpenSSL 1.1.1 if you compile with the “legacy” provider).  
Feel free to replace the dummy *shared secret* (`Z`) and the *OtherInfo* values with the data you actually have (e.g. the ECDH shared secret and algorithm‑specific context).

