 *
 *  - Input : a sequence of signed 32‑bit integers (int32_t)
 *  - Output: length of the LIS and one possible subsequence
 *
 *  Security‑oriented notes:
 *      • All dynamic allocations are checked for failure.
 *      • All integer calculations use size_t (or int64_t) to avoid overflow.
