## 4. Client (`client.c`)

```c
/*
 * client.c – builds a request, sends it via the command shm,
 *            and (for reads) receives the reply shm.
 *
 * Build:   gcc -Wall -Wextra client.c -o client
 * Run:     ./client "read myfile.txt"
 *          ./client "write myfile.txt some text to store"
