TAOUFYQ Anass
Kamal Ramdhan
AZZOUZI Salah
OUCHARRA Hiba
BOULOIZ Aya
SEDKI Rim
3 1 2 5 4 3 5 3 5 3 2 8 1 6 7 7 3 5 6 9 3 4 7 1 2 4 5 5 1 4
```

Compile and execute:

```bash
gcc -Wall -Wextra -O2 -o election election.c
./election
```

`resultats.txt` will contain:

```
