*If no `$` appears.*  
`joker_used` stays `false`. The `else` branch of the joker handling executes
and multiplies the points of `categories.back()` (the last category) by `2`.
Again, only this one category is modified. ∎



##### Lemma 4  
`halftime_points` equals the sum of points of the first
`ceil(N/2)` categories, where `N` is the total number of categories.

**Proof.**  
`half_cnt` is computed as `(N+1)/2`. For an integer division this equals
