categories, which are precisely the first `⌈N/2⌉` categories. ∎



##### Theorem  
The program produced by the algorithm

1. prints, for every input category, the required answer string;
2. prints the correct halftime points;
3. prints the correct total points.

**Proof.**  

1. By Lemma&nbsp;2 each printed line contains exactly the desired characters,
