order.  
The statement requires that we exchange *nodes* of the list, not only their
data fields, therefore we really have to reverse the list by rewiring the
pointers.

The program must also be robust: any token that is not a correct integer or the
terminating dot must be ignored – this is the “protection from incorrect input”.

