## 5️⃣ 代码原型（关键类）  

下面给出 **最小可运行的安全原型**（省略 UI 细节），帮助你快速落地：

### 5.1 `SecureChatServer`（TLS + 线程池）

```java
public final class SecureChatServer {
    private static final int PORT = 8443;
    private final SSLServerSocket serverSocket;
    private final ExecutorService pool = Executors.newFixedThreadPool(20);
    private final Semaphore sessionSlots = new Semaphore(50); // 最大并发聊天

    public SecureChatServer() throws Exception {
        // 初始化 TLS (见 3.1)
        // … (同上代码) …
        this.serverSocket = (SSLServerSocket) ssf.createServerSocket(PORT);
    }

    public void start() throws IOException {
        System.out.println("[SERVER] Listening on " + PORT);
        while (true) {
            SSLSocket client = (SSLSocket) serverSocket.accept();
            if (!sessionSlots.tryAcquire()) {
                sendBusy(client);
                continue;
            }
            pool.execute(() -> {
                try {
                    new SessionHandler(client).run(); // 每个会话的业务处理
                } finally {
                    sessionSlots.release();
                    try { client.close(); } catch (Exception ignored) {}
                }
            });
        }
    }

    private static void sendBusy(Socket s) throws IOException {
        OutputStream out = s.getOutputStream();
        out.write("{\"cmd\":\"BUSY\"}\n".getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8));
        out.flush();
        s.close();
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {
        new SecureChatServer().start();
    }
}
```

### 5.2 `SessionHandler`（业务协议、文件存储、聊天记录）

```java
public class SessionHandler implements Runnable {
    private final SSLSocket socket;
    private final DataInputStream in;
    private final DataOutputStream out;
    private String userId;   // 登录后填充
    private String token;    // 会话 token
    private long seq = 0L;   // 客户端 seq（防重放）

    public SessionHandler(SSLSocket socket) throws IOException {
        this.socket = socket;
        this.socket.setSoTimeout(30_000); // 读取超时
        this.in = new DataInputStream(socket.getInputStream());
        this.out = new DataOutputStream(socket.getOutputStream());
    }

    @Override
    public void run() {
        try {
            // 1️⃣ 登录（简化示例，只是 token 验证）
            String loginMsg = readMessage();
            JSONObject login = new JSONObject(loginMsg);
            this.userId = login.getString("user");
            this.token  = login.getString("token");
            if (!TokenUtil.verify(token, userId)) {
                sendError("INVALID_TOKEN");
                return;
            }

            // 2️⃣ 主循环：读取业务报文
            while (true) {
                String raw = readMessage(); // 长度前缀 + JSON
                if (raw == null) break; // 客户端关闭
                JSONObject msg = new JSONObject(raw);
                // 校验序列号
                long msgSeq = msg.getLong("seq");
                if (msgSeq <= seq) {
                    sendError("SEQ_OUT_OF_ORDER");
                    continue;
                }
                seq = msgSeq;

                // 业务分发
                handleCommand(msg);
            }
        } catch (SocketTimeoutException e) {
            logWarn("Idle timeout, closing session");
        } catch (Exception e) {
            logError("Unexpected", e);
        } finally {
            try { socket.close(); } catch (Exception ignored) {}
        }
    }

    // -----------------------------------------------------------------
    private String readMessage() throws IOException {
        // 4-byte length prefix (big‑endian)
        int len;
        try {
            len = in.readInt();
        } catch (EOFException e) {
            return null;
        }
        if (len <= 0 || len > 10_000_000) { // 限制最大 10 MB
            throw new IOException("非法报文长度: " + len);
        }
        byte[] buf = new byte[len];
        in.readFully(buf);
        return new String(buf, StandardCharsets.UTF_8);
    }

    private void sendMessage(JSONObject obj) throws IOException {
        byte[] data = obj.toString().getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8);
        out.writeInt(data.length);
        out.write(data);
        out.flush();
    }

    private void sendError(String reason) throws IOException {
        JSONObject o = new JSONObject()
                .put("cmd","ERROR")
                .put("reason",reason);
        sendMessage(o);
    }

    // -----------------------------------------------------------------
    private void handleCommand(JSONObject msg) throws Exception {
        String cmd = msg.getString("cmd");
        switch (cmd) {
            case "TEXT":
                handleText(msg);
                break;
            case "IMAGE":
            case "FILE":
                handleFile(msg);
                break;
            case "REQUEST_SERVICE":
                // 这里可以转发给客服端线程或写入共享队列
                forwardToStaff(msg);
                break;
            default:
                sendError("UNKNOWN_CMD");
        }
    }

    private void handleText(JSONObject msg) throws Exception {
        String text = msg.getString("payload");
        // 记录到本地日志
        Path log = Paths.get("data", "users", userId, "chat.log");
        ChatLogCrypto.appendLog(log, "[USER] " + text);
        // 回显（实际场景会转发给客服端）
        JSONObject resp = new JSONObject()
                .put("cmd","TEXT_ACK")
                .put("seq", seq);
        sendMessage(resp);
    }

    private void handleFile(JSONObject msg) throws Exception {
        JSONObject p = msg.getJSONObject("payload");
        String filename = p.getString("filename");
        long size = p.getLong("size");
        if (size > 10 * 1024 * 1024) { // 10 MB 限制
            sendError("FILE_TOO_LARGE");
            return;
        }
        String b64 = p.getString("data");
        byte[] data = Base64.getDecoder().decode(b64);
        // 保存（安全写入）
        Path stored = FileStorage.storeFile(data, filename, Long.parseLong(userId));
        // 记录日志
        Path log = Paths.get("data", "users", userId, "chat.log");
        ChatLogCrypto.appendLog(log, "[USER_SENT_FILE] " + stored.getFileName());
        // 回执
        JSONObject ack = new JSONObject()
                .put("cmd","FILE_ACK")
                .put("seq",seq)
                .put("payload", new JSONObject()
                        .put("savedName", stored.getFileName().toString()));
        sendMessage(ack);
    }

    // -----------------------------------------------------------------
    // 简化的转发实现：在真实系统里应使用 ConcurrentMap<staffId,SessionHandler>
    private void forwardToStaff(JSONObject msg) throws IOException {
        // 暂时直接回一个“已转发”给用户
        JSONObject resp = new JSONObject()
                .put("cmd","FORWARDED")
                .put("seq",seq);
        sendMessage(resp);
    }

    // -----------------------------------------------------------------
    private void logWarn(String s) {
        System.out.println("[WARN] " + s);
    }
    private void logError(String s, Exception e) {
        System.err.println("[ERROR] " + s);
        e.printStackTrace();
    }
}
```

> **说明**  
> - **长度前缀** 防止粘包，`int` 最大 2 GB，实际业务限制为 10 MB。  
> - **seq** 必须递增，防止 **重放攻击**。  
> - **文件保存** 通过 `FileStorage.storeFile`（见 3.5）实现。  
> - **聊天记录** 使用 `ChatLogCrypto.appendLog`（加密）保存。  
> - **异常捕获** 统一记录审计日志。  

