## 2️⃣ 使用 SnakeYAML

### 2.1 Maven / Gradle 依賴

```xml
<!-- pom.xml -->
<dependency>
    <groupId>org.yaml</groupId>
    <artifactId>snakeyaml</artifactId>
    <version>2.2</version>
</dependency>
```

```gradle
// build.gradle
implementation 'org.yaml:snakeyaml:2.2'
```

> **版本**：2.2 以上已支援 `java.util.LinkedHashMap` 保持原始鍵的順序，適合配置文件。

### 2.2 定義 POJO（推薦）  

假設 `crawler-config.yaml` 內容如下：

```yaml
crawler:
  enabled: true
  threadPoolSize: 10
  urls:
    - https://example.com
    - https://foo.bar
  retryPolicy:
    maxAttempts: 3
    backoffMs: 500
```

```java
// 1. 最外層的根節點
public class CrawlerConfig {
    private Crawler crawler;

    // getters / setters
    public static class Crawler {
        private boolean enabled;
        private int threadPoolSize;
        private List<String> urls;
        private RetryPolicy retryPolicy;
        // getters / setters
    }

    public static class RetryPolicy {
        private int maxAttempts;
        private long backoffMs;
        // getters / setters
    }
}
```

### 2.3 讀取 → 反序列化

```java
import org.yaml.snakeyaml.Yaml;
import org.yaml.snakeyaml.constructor.Constructor;

// 讀取 Nacos 配置
ConfigService service = NacosFactory.createConfigService(properties);
String yamlStr = service.getConfig("crawler-config.yaml", "DEFAULT_GROUP", 5000);

// 轉成 POJO
Yaml yaml = new Yaml(new Constructor(CrawlerConfig.class));
CrawlerConfig config = yaml.load(yamlStr);
```

### 2.4 直接操作 POJO

```java
// 例子：關閉爬蟲、把 threadPoolSize 加到 20
config.getCrawler().setEnabled(false);
config.getCrawler().setThreadPoolSize(20);
```

### 2.5 序列化回 String

```java
// 需要設置美化輸出（縮排等），避免一次性寫成單行
DumperOptions options = new DumperOptions();
options.setDefaultFlowStyle(DumperOptions.FlowStyle.BLOCK); // block style (多行)
options.setIndent(2);
options.setPrettyFlow(true);
options.setDefaultScalarStyle(DumperOptions.ScalarStyle.PLAIN);
Yaml yamlWriter = new Yaml(options);

String newYaml = yamlWriter.dump(config);
```

### 2.6 發佈回 Nacos

```java
boolean ok = service.publishConfig(
        "crawler-config.yaml",
        "DEFAULT_GROUP",
        newYaml
);
if (!ok) {
    throw new IllegalStateException("Publish to Nacos failed!");
}
