  refresh-window: 5m       # how long before expiration a refresh token can be used
```

> **Why Redis?**  
> JWTs are *stateless*, but we need *session revocation* and *per‑functionality scoping*.  
> Storing a lightweight “session fingerprint” in Redis gives us constant‑time revocation while still letting the token stay stateless for the happy‑path.

