| **Per‑frame HMAC** | Even if TLS is terminated upstream (e.g., TLS‑offload), integrity is still guaranteed. |
| **Heartbeat** | Avoids endless socket hangs, helps detect MITM that drops traffic. |
| **Input sanitisation** (not shown) | Do **not** trust image payloads; treat them as opaque blobs unless you need to parse them. Use a library that rejects malformed/over‑sized images before writing to disk. |

