## 5. 完整代码示例（进阶：加入 HMAC + Pinning）

下面给出一个 **生产级** 示例：POST JSON，使用 **OkHttp**，实现**HMAC 签名**、**证书钉扎**、**可选的调试日志**。

```java
public final class SecurePostClient {

    // ==== 配置区 ====
    private static final String BASE_URL = "https://api.example.com/";
    private static final String HMAC_ALGORITHM = "HmacSHA256";
    private static final String HMAC_KEY = "YOUR_SECRET_KEY"; // 业务侧安全存储，勿硬编码到源码
    private static final String[] PINNED_CERTS = {
            // ca8b... 为 SHA-256 公钥指纹（使用 openssl x509 -pubkey -noout -in cert.pem | openssl pkeyutl -sign -inkey ...）
            "sha256/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA="
    };
    private static final boolean DEBUG = BuildConfig.DEBUG;
    // ==== END 配置 ====

    private static final OkHttpClient client;

    static {
        // 1️⃣ 证书钉扎
        CertificatePinner.Builder pinnerBuilder = new CertificatePinner.Builder();
        for (String pin : PINNED_CERTS) {
            pinnerBuilder.add(HttpUrl.parse(BASE_URL).host(), pin);
        }
        CertificatePinner pinner = pinnerBuilder.build();

        // 2️⃣ 日志拦截器（仅 Debug）
        HttpLoggingInterceptor logger = new HttpLoggingInterceptor();
        logger.setLevel(DEBUG ? HttpLoggingInterceptor.Level.BODY : HttpLoggingInterceptor.Level.NONE);

        // 3️⃣ HMAC 拦截器（在 Header 中注入 Signature、Timestamp、Nonce）
        Interceptor hmacInterceptor = chain -> {
            Request original = chain.request();
            String nonce = UUID.randomUUID().toString();
            String timestamp = String.valueOf(System.currentTimeMillis() / 1000L);
            String bodyString = bodyToString(original.body());

            // 待签名格式: METHOD + PATH + TIMESTAMP + NONCE + BODY
            String signingData = original.method()
                    + original.url().encodedPath()
                    + timestamp
                    + nonce
                    + (bodyString != null ? bodyString : "");

            String signature = hmac(signingData, HMAC_KEY);

            Request signed = original.newBuilder()
                    .header("X-Request-Nonce", nonce)
                    .header("X-Request-Timestamp", timestamp)
                    .header("X-Request-Signature", signature)
                    .build();

            return chain.proceed(signed);
        };

        client = new OkHttpClient.Builder()
                .certificatePinner(pinner)
                .addInterceptor(hmacInterceptor)
                .addInterceptor(logger)
                .connectTimeout(15, TimeUnit.SECONDS)
                .readTimeout(20, TimeUnit.SECONDS)
                .build();
    }

    /** 发送 JSON POST 并返回响应体 */
    public static String postJson(String endpoint, String json) throws IOException {
        MediaType JSON = MediaType.get("application/json; charset=utf-8");
        RequestBody body = RequestBody.create(json, JSON);
        Request request = new Request.Builder()
                .url(BASE_URL + endpoint)
                .post(body)
                .build();

        try (Response response = client.newCall(request).execute()) {
            if (!response.isSuccessful()) {
                // 生产环境请不要把整个 body 直接抛给前端，记录日志后返回统一错误码
                throw new IOException("HTTP " + response.code()
                        + " " + response.message());
            }
            return response.body().string();
        }
    }

    // --------------------------- 辅助工具 ---------------------------

    /** 将 RequestBody 读取为字符串（仅用于签名，勿在生产中频繁使用） */
    private static String bodyToString(final RequestBody body) {
        if (body == null) return null;
        try (Buffer buffer = new Buffer()) {
            body.writeTo(buffer);
            return buffer.readUtf8();
        } catch (IOException e) {
            return null;
        }
    }

    /** HMAC 加密 */
    private static String hmac(String data, String secret) {
        try {
            SecretKeySpec keySpec = new SecretKeySpec(secret.getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8), HMAC_ALGORITHM);
            Mac mac = Mac.getInstance(HMAC_ALGORITHM);
            mac.init(keySpec);
            byte[] raw = mac.doFinal(data.getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8));
            return Base64.encodeToString(raw, Base64.NO_WRAP);
        } catch (Exception e) {
            throw new RuntimeException("HMAC error", e);
        }
    }
}
```

**说明**  

- **证书钉扎**：只接受 `api.example.com` 公钥指纹匹配的证书。即使攻击者拥有合法 CA 颁发的伪造证书，也会被拒绝。  
