| Feature | How to add it |
|---------|---------------|
| **Multiple concurrent streams** | Keep a `ConcurrentHashMap<Integer, ClientHandler>` keyed by a stream‑ID; spawn a new `Piped*` pair + thread per client. Enforce a global max‑connections limit (`ExecutorService` with bounded queue). |
