## 2️⃣ Migration Checklist (Spring 5 → Spring 6)

| Spring 5 pattern | Spring 6 equivalent | Research notes |
|------------------|---------------------|----------------|
| `extends WebSecurityConfigurerAdapter` | Declare `SecurityFilterChain` + `AuthenticationManager` beans | Removing the adapter makes **configuration more explicit**, but you may inadvertently forget to expose `AuthenticationManager`. |
