### 4.2 客户端（User）

```java
public class UserClient {
    private final String host;
    private final int port;
    private SSLSocket socket;
    private BufferedReader in;
    private BufferedWriter out;
    private final ObjectMapper json = new ObjectMapper();
    private final ExecutorService netExec = Executors.newSingleThreadExecutor(); // 网络读写线程
    private final String token; // 客户端会在握手后通过服务器下发

    public UserClient(String host, int port) {
        this.host = host;
        this.port = port;
        this.token = UUID.randomUUID().toString(); // 本地临时，用于 UI 匹配
    }

    public void start() throws Exception {
        socket = SslUtil.createSslClientSocket(host, port);
        in = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(socket.getInputStream(), StandardCharsets.UTF_8));
        out = new BufferedWriter(new OutputStreamWriter(socket.getOutputStream(), StandardCharsets.UTF_8));

        // 启动读取线程
        netExec.submit(this::readLoop);
    }

    private void readLoop() {
        try {
            String line;
            while ((line = in.readLine()) != null) {
                JsonNode msg = json.readTree(line);
                // UI 主线程展示
                SwingUtilities.invokeLater(() -> UiUserPanel.receiveMessage(msg));
            }
        } catch (Exception e) {
            Log.error("User readLoop error", e);
        }
    }

    // ---------- UI 触发的发送方法 ----------
    public void sendText(String text) throws IOException {
        ObjectNode n = json.createObjectNode();
        n.put("type", "text");
        n.put("seq", nextSeq());
        n.put("token", token);
        ObjectNode payload = n.putObject("payload");
        payload.put("content", text);
        send(n);
    }

    public void sendFile(Path filePath) throws IOException {
        // 读取文件，Base64 编码，分块发送（示例只发送一次完整块）
        byte[] data = Files.readAllBytes(filePath);
        if (data.length > MAX_FILE_SIZE) {
            throw new IllegalArgumentException("文件太大");
        }
        String b64 = Base64.getEncoder().encodeToString(data);
        ObjectNode n = json.createObjectNode();
        n.put("type", "file");
        n.put("seq", nextSeq());
        n.put("token", token);
        ObjectNode payload = n.putObject("payload");
        payload.put("name", filePath.getFileName().toString());
        payload.put("size", data.length);
        payload.put("data", b64);
        send(n);
    }

    private void send(ObjectNode node) throws IOException {
        out.write(node.toString());
        out.newLine();
        out.flush();
    }

    private final AtomicLong seqGen = new AtomicLong(0);
    private long nextSeq() { return seqGen.incrementAndGet(); }

    public void close() {
        try { socket.close(); } catch (IOException ignored) {}
        netExec.shutdownNow();
    }
}
```

- **UI层**（`UiUserPanel`）只负责调用 `UserClient.sendXXX`，并把收到的消息渲染到 Swing `JTextPane` 中。  
- **文件/图片** 上传前在 UI 进行 **大小/后缀** 校验，若超限直接弹框提示。  

