**Client 2 (O)** – repeat the same command in the second terminal.

You should see two JavaFX windows appear, each labelled “You are X” or “You are O”. The board will be empty; the player with **X** gets the first “TURN”. Click a cell → the move is sent to the server → both windows update. The game ends with a proper “WIN/LOSS/DRAW” message.

