| **E** | `java --module-path $FX_PATH --add-modules=javafx.controls,javafx.graphics -jar build/client.jar localhost 5555 client.truststore changeit` | Launch a client (repeat for the second player). |
| **F** | Play! | Click empty cells when “Your turn”. |
| **G** | **Security testing** – run the fuzzer or the checklist above. | Verify the server never crashes and respects the protocol. |

Enjoy the game, and treat the source as a **learning sandbox** for secure client‑server Java development! If you need a more production‑ready template (match‑making service, persistent scores, WebSocket API, etc.), feel free to ask – the same principles (TLS, state‑machine validation, strict input sanitisation) apply. Happy hacking!

