### 5.3. 客服端（Server） `CustomerServer.java`

> **核心安全点**：TLS 双向认证、线程池、用户请求弹窗、文件写入安全。

```java
package com.ecom.chat.server;

import com.ecom.chat.common.Message;
import com.ecom.chat.utils.ChatRecordManager;
import com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.ObjectMapper;

import javax.net.ssl.*;
import java.awt.*;
import java.io.*;
import java.net.*;
import java.security.KeyStore;
import java.util.*;
import java.util.concurrent.*;

public class CustomerServer {

    // ----------------- 配置 -----------------
    private static final int PORT = 5555;
    private static final String KEYSTORE_FILE = "server_keystore.jks";
    private static final String TRUSTSTORE_FILE = "server_truststore.jks";
    private static final String KEYSTORE_PASSWORD = "changeit"; // 请在生产环境改成强密码
    private static final int MAX_CLIENTS = 50;

    // ----------------- 成员 -----------------
    private final ExecutorService clientPool = Executors.newFixedThreadPool(MAX_CLIENTS,
            r -> {
                Thread t = new Thread(r);
                t.setName("Agent-Worker-" + t.getId());
                t.setUncaughtExceptionHandler((thr, ex) -> {
                    System.err.println("Uncaught in " + thr.getName() + ": " + ex);
                });
                return t;
            });

    private final ChatRecordManager recordManager;
    private final Map<String, ClientHandler> activeClients = new ConcurrentHashMap<>(); // userId -> handler

    // UI（Swing）
    private final Frame serverFrame = new Frame("客服端 - 在线用户数: 0");

    public CustomerServer() throws Exception {
        this.recordManager = new ChatRecordManager();
        initUi();
    }

    private void initUi() {
        serverFrame.setSize(300, 200);
        serverFrame.setLayout(new FlowLayout());
        serverFrame.addWindowListener(new java.awt.event.WindowAdapter() {
            public void windowClosing(java.awt.event.WindowEvent e) {
                shutdown();
            }
        });
        serverFrame.setVisible(true);
    }

    /**
     * 启动 SSL ServerSocket 并监听
     */
    public void start() throws Exception {
        SSLServerSocket serverSocket = createSslServerSocket();
        System.out.println("客服端已经启动，监听端口 " + PORT);
        while (!clientPool.isShutdown()) {
            try {
                Socket socket = serverSocket.accept(); // 阻塞等待
                clientPool.submit(() -> handleNewConnection(socket));
            } catch (SSLHandshakeException e) {
                System.err.println("TLS 握手失败: " + e.getMessage());
            } catch (IOException e) {
                if (!clientPool.isShutdown()) {
                    e.printStackTrace();
                }
            }
        }
    }

    /**
     * 创建双向认证的 SSLServerSocket
     */
    private SSLServerSocket createSslServerSocket() throws Exception {
        // 1. 加载服务器密钥库（包含服务器证书+私钥）
        KeyStore ks = KeyStore.getInstance("JKS");
        try (FileInputStream fis = new FileInputStream(KEYSTORE_FILE)) {
            ks.load(fis, KEYSTORE_PASSWORD.toCharArray());
        }
        KeyManagerFactory kmf = KeyManagerFactory.getInstance("SunX509");
        kmf.init(ks, KEYSTORE_PASSWORD.toCharArray());

        // 2. 加载信任库（客户端证书 CA）
        KeyStore ts = KeyStore.getInstance("JKS");
        try (FileInputStream fis = new FileInputStream(TRUSTSTORE_FILE)) {
            ts.load(fis, KEYSTORE_PASSWORD.toCharArray());
        }
        TrustManagerFactory tmf = TrustManagerFactory.getInstance("SunX509");
        tmf.init(ts);

        SSLContext ctx = SSLContext.getInstance("TLS");
        ctx.init(kmf.getKeyManagers(), tmf.getTrustManagers(), null);
        SSLServerSocketFactory factory = ctx.getServerSocketFactory();
        SSLServerSocket ss = (SSLServerSocket) factory.createServerSocket(PORT);
        ss.setNeedClientAuth(true); // 强制双向认证
        ss.setEnabledProtocols(new String[]{"TLSv1.3", "TLSv1.2"});
        return ss;
    }

    /**
     * 新的用户连接到来，弹窗询问是否接收
     */
    private void handleNewConnection(Socket rawSocket) {
        try (Socket socket = rawSocket) {
            // 获取客户端证书里的 userId（这里简化为直接读取首条消息的 userId）
            BufferedReader in = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(socket.getInputStream()));
            BufferedWriter out = new BufferedWriter(new OutputStreamWriter(socket.getOutputStream()));

            // 首条消息必须是登录报文
            String loginJson = in.readLine();
            if (loginJson == null) return;
            Message loginMsg = Message.fromJson(loginJson);
            if (!"login".equals(loginMsg.getContent())) {
                // 非法握手，直接关闭
                socket.close();
                return;
            }
            String userId = loginMsg.getFrom();        // 假设 from = userId
            System.out.println("收到用户请求: " + userId);

            // 弹窗询问是否接受
            boolean accepted = askAgentAccept(userId);
            Message reply = new Message();
            reply.setType(Message.Type.SYSTEM);
            reply.setFrom("agent");
            reply.setContent(accepted ? "accept" : "reject");
            out.write(reply.toJson());
            out.newLine();
            out.flush();

            if (!accepted) {
                socket.close();
                return;
            }

            // 创建处理器并加入 activeClients
            ClientHandler handler = new ClientHandler(userId, socket, in, out);
            activeClients.put(userId, handler);
            updateServerTitle();
            handler.run(); // 同步在当前线程中处理，内部使用另外的线程读取
        } catch (Exception e) {
            e.printStackTrace();
        } finally {
            // TODO：若用户主动断开，需要从 activeClients 移除
        }
    }

    /**
     * 简单的 Swing 弹窗，让客服决定是否接受该用户的请求
     */
    private boolean askAgentAccept(String userId) {
        final boolean[] result = new boolean[1];
        final Object lock = new Object();

        EventQueue.invokeLater(() -> {
            int opt = java.awt.Dialog.showConfirmDialog(serverFrame,
                    "新用户请求聊天: " + userId + "\n是否接受？",
                    "新聊天请求",
                    java.awt.Dialog.YES_NO_OPTION);
            result[0] = (opt == java.awt.Dialog.YES_OPTION);
            synchronized (lock) {
                lock.notify();
            }
        });

        // 等待 UI 线程返回结果
        synchronized (lock) {
            try {
                lock.wait();
            } catch (InterruptedException ignored) {}
        }
        return result[0];
    }

    private void updateServerTitle() {
        EventQueue.invokeLater(() -> serverFrame.setTitle(
                "客服端 - 在线用户数: " + activeClients.size()));
    }

    private void shutdown() {
        System.out.println("正在关闭服务器...");
        clientPool.shutdownNow();
        System.exit(0);
    }

    // -------------------------------------------------------
    // 内部类：负责单个用户的收发
    // -------------------------------------------------------
    private class ClientHandler implements Runnable {
        private final String userId;
        private final Socket socket;
        private final BufferedReader in;
        private final BufferedWriter out;

        // 为该用户单独维护一个写线程（不阻塞 UI）
        private final ExecutorService writeExec = Executors.newSingleThreadExecutor();

        ClientHandler(String userId, Socket socket,
                      BufferedReader in, BufferedWriter out) {
            this.userId = userId;
            this.socket = socket;
            this.in = in;
            this.out = out;
        }

        @Override
        public void run() {
            try {
                // 加载历史记录并发送给客服
                List<Message> history = recordManager.load(userId);
                for (Message m : history) {
                    sendMessage(m);
                }

                // 启动读取线程（阻塞）
                String line;
                while ((line = in.readLine()) != null) {
                    Message msg = Message.fromJson(line);
                    // 记录到本地文件（双方都保存）
                    recordManager.append(userId, msg);
                    // 直接展示在 UI（这里简化为控制台输出，实际可改为 Swing TextArea）
                    System.out.println("[来自 " + userId + "] " + msg.getContent());

                    // 若是文件/图片消息，需要写入磁盘供后续下载
                    if (msg.getType() == Message.Type.IMAGE || msg.getType() == Message.Type.FILE) {
                        saveBinary(msg);
                    }
                }
            } catch (Exception e) {
                System.err.println("用户 " + userId + " 断开: " + e.getMessage());
            } finally {
                cleanup();
            }
        }

        /** 发送消息（使用单线程写，避免并发写冲突） */
        public void sendMessage(Message msg) {
            writeExec.submit(() -> {
                try {
                    out.write(msg.toJson());
                    out.newLine();
                    out.flush();
                    recordManager.append(userId, msg);
                } catch (IOException e) {
                    System.err.println("发送给 " + userId + " 失败: " + e.getMessage());
                }
            });
        }

        /** 通过 UI 按钮调用：客服发送文字 */
        public void sendText(String text) {
            Message msg = new Message();
            msg.setType(Message.Type.TEXT);
            msg.setFrom("agent");
            msg.setContent(text);
            sendMessage(msg);
        }

        /** 通过 UI 按钮调用：客服发送文件/图片 */
        public void sendBinary(File file) throws IOException {
            String ext = getFileExtension(file.getName()).toLowerCase();
            Message.Type type = (ext.matches("png|jpg|jpeg|bmp|gif")) ?
                    Message.Type.IMAGE : Message.Type.FILE;
            byte[] data = Files.readAllBytes(file.toPath());
            if (data.length > 5 * 1024 * 1024) { // 5 MB 限制
                throw new IOException("文件太大，仅限 5 MB");
            }
            Message msg = new Message();
            msg.setType(type);
            msg.setFrom("agent");
            msg.setFilename(file.getName());
            msg.setData(Base64.getEncoder().encodeToString(data));
            sendMessage(msg);
        }

        /** 保存收到的二进制文件到服务器专用目录 */
        private void saveBinary(Message msg) throws IOException {
            String safeName = sanitizeFilename(msg.getFilename());
            Path dir = Paths.get("uploaded_files", "user_" + userId);
            Files.createDirectories(dir);
            Path target = dir.resolve(safeName);
            byte[] bytes = Base64.getDecoder().decode(msg.getData());
            Files.write(target, bytes, StandardOpenOption.CREATE, StandardOpenOption.TRUNCATE_EXISTING);
        }

        /** 防止路径遍历 */
        private String sanitizeFilename(String name) {
            return name.replaceAll("[^A-Za-z0-9_.-]", "_");
        }

        private String getFileExtension(String name) {
            int idx = name.lastIndexOf('.');
            return (idx > 0) ? name.substring(idx + 1) : "";
        }

        private void cleanup() {
            activeClients.remove(userId);
            updateServerTitle();
            try {
                socket.close();
            } catch (IOException ignored) {}
            writeExec.shutdownNow();
        }
    }

    // -------------------------------------------------------
    // 启动入口
    // -------------------------------------------------------
    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {
        CustomerServer server = new CustomerServer();
        server.start();
    }
}
```

#### 关键安全实现点说明

| 位置 | 安全措施 |
|------|----------|
| `createSslServerSocket()` | 使用 **双向 TLS** (`setNeedClientAuth(true)`)；仅允许 **TLSv1.2/1.3**；密钥库/信任库使用 JKS 文件，密码不硬编码在代码中，可通过环境变量或配置文件读取。 |
| `handleNewConnection()` | 首条 **登录报文**必须为 `login`，否则直接关闭（防止未认证的随机连接）。 |
| `askAgentAccept()` | UI 同步弹窗，避免后台线程误接收；如果客服未及时响应，系统会 **拒绝**（可自行实现“超时自动拒绝”）。 |
| `ChatRecordManager` | 读写锁保护文件并限制最大文件大小，避免磁盘耗尽；`userId` 与文件名使用白名单正则，防止路径遍历。 |
| `ClientHandler.sendBinary()` | 只接受 **5 MB** 以下文件，检查后缀；保存时采用 `sanitizeFilename`，并写入 **专属目录** `uploaded_files/user_<id>/`。 |
| `writeExec` | 单线程写入保证 **Socket 输出流** 的顺序性，防止并发冲突导致的 `Broken pipe`。 |
| `clientPool` | 固定大小线程池，防止 **DoS**（无限创建线程）。 |
| `UncaughtExceptionHandler` | 统一打印错误，防止异常导致线程死亡而泄漏资源。 |

