### 2.2 采用 Spring Boot + WebSocket (STOMP)

WebSocket 更适合 **双向**、**低延迟** 场景，同时能在同一连接上复用多次请求。下面给出最小实现，用 `TextMessage` 逐字符发送。

#### 2️⃣ 依赖

```xml
<dependency>
    <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
    <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-websocket</artifactId>
</dependency>
```

#### 2️⃣ 配置

```java
@Configuration
@EnableWebSocketMessageBroker
public class WebSocketConfig implements WebSocketMessageBrokerConfigurer {

    @Override
    public void configureMessageBroker(MessageBrokerRegistry registry) {
        // 简单内存代理，主题 /topic 用于推送
        registry.enableSimpleBroker("/topic");
        registry.setApplicationDestinationPrefixes("/app");
    }

    @Override
    public void registerStompEndpoints(StompEndpointRegistry registry) {
        // 浏览器通过 ws://host:port/ws 建立连接
        registry.addEndpoint("/ws-chat")
                .setAllowedOrigins("https://your-frontend.com") // CORS 严格控制
                .withSockJS(); // 支持 fallback（如不想使用 SockJS 则去掉）
    }
}
```

#### 2️⃣ 控制器

```java
@Controller
public class ChatWebSocketController {

    private final AnswerProvider answerProvider;

    public ChatWebSocketController(AnswerProvider answerProvider) {
        this.answerProvider = answerProvider;
    }

    // 前端发送请求的目标地址
    @MessageMapping("/question")
    @SendTo("/topic/answer")
    public Flux<String> handleQuestion(String question) {
        // 同 SSE 示例，获取完整答案
        String answer = answerProvider.generateAnswer(question);
        // 将答案拆成字符流并延迟发送
        return Flux.fromIterable(answer.split(""))
                   .delayElements(Duration.ofMillis(30));
