**ImageUploadController.java**（处理外部图片）

```java
@RestController
@RequestMapping("/api")
public class ImageUploadController {

    @PostMapping(value = "/frame", consumes = MediaType.MULTIPART_FORM_DATA_VALUE)
    public ResponseEntity<String> receive(@RequestParam("file") MultipartFile file,
                                          @RequestHeader("X-Session-Id") String sessId) throws Exception {
        // 1️⃣ MIME & size check
        if (!file.getContentType().startsWith("image/")) {
            return ResponseEntity.badRequest().body("Not an image");
        }
        if (file.getSize() > 2_000_000) {
            return ResponseEntity.status(HttpStatus.PAYLOAD_TOO_LARGE).body("Too big");
        }

        // 2️⃣ Decode to BufferedImage (avoid ImageIO DOS by limiting dimension)
        BufferedImage img = ImageIO.read(file.getInputStream());
        if (img == null) {
            return ResponseEntity.badRequest().body("Invalid image");
        }
        // 3️⃣ Find the WebSocket session (maintained in a static map)
        WebSocketSession ws = H264StreamingHandler.sessionMap.get(sessId);
        if (ws == null) {
            return ResponseEntity.status(HttpStatus.NOT_FOUND).body("Ws session not found");
        }

        // 4️⃣ Push to encoder
        H264StreamingHandler handler = (H264StreamingHandler) ws.getAttributes()
                                   .get("handler");
        handler.pushFrame(ws, img);
        return ResponseEntity.ok("Accepted");
    }
}
```

> **审计点**：  
> - `ImageIO.read` 可能会解析恶意 JPEG（触发 **CVE‑2022‑xxxx**），因此要 **限制解码尺寸**，或使用 **libjpeg‑turbo** 替代。  
> - 通过 **session id**（JWT 里的 `sub`）映射 WebSocket，防止 **session fixation**。

