| **JWT/Token 验证** | Spring Security `BearerTokenAuthenticationFilter` |
| **输入图片校验** | Apache Commons Imaging `Imaging.getImageInfo` 检测 dimensions |
| **内存/CPU 监控** | Prometheus + Grafana 监控 `process_cpu_seconds_total`、`process_resident_memory_bytes` |
| **异常日志审计** | `ffmpeg -loglevel error` 输出到专用日志，集中到 ELK/Graylog |
| **安全审计** | Run `spotbugs`, `findsecbugs`, `OWASP Dependency-Check` 对依赖进行 CVE 扫描 |
| **负载/速率限制** | NGINX `limit_req_zone $binary_remote_addr zone=ws:10m rate=10r/s;` |

