### 1.2 Client 端（阻塞式）

```java
import java.io.*;
import java.net.*;

public class BlockingClient {
    private static final String SERVER_HOST = "127.0.0.1";
    private static final int SERVER_PORT = 8888;
    // 读取响应的超时时间，推荐设置，防止服务端失联时一直阻塞
    private static final int READ_TIMEOUT = 10_000; // 10 秒

    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {
        try (Socket socket = new Socket()) {
            // 1. 主动发起连接（阻塞，直到三次握手完成或超时）
            socket.connect(new InetSocketAddress(SERVER_HOST, SERVER_PORT), READ_TIMEOUT);
            System.out.println("[+] Connected to " + SERVER_HOST + ":" + SERVER_PORT);

            // 2. 设置读取超时（不影响写操作）
            socket.setSoTimeout(READ_TIMEOUT);

            // 3. 双向阻塞 I/O
            try (BufferedReader console = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));
                 BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(socket.getInputStream(), "UTF-8"));
                 BufferedWriter bw = new BufferedWriter(new OutputStreamWriter(socket.getOutputStream(), "UTF-8"))) {

                String userInput;
                while ((userInput = console.readLine()) != null) {
                    bw.write(userInput);
                    bw.newLine();
                    bw.flush();

                    // 读取服务端回显（阻塞）
                    String response = br.readLine(); // 受 setSoTimeout 影响
                    System.out.println("[Server] " + response);

                    if ("quit".equalsIgnoreCase(userInput.trim())) {
                        break;
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
```

**要点**：

- `socket.connect(..., timeout)`：连接阶段同样可以设置超时，防止网络不通时无限阻塞。
- `socket.setSoTimeout(timeout)`：只能控制 **读取** 阶段的阻塞，不会影响 `write()`。
- 使用 `try-with-resources` 自动关闭 `Socket`，确保资源及时回收。

