## Common pitfalls & troubleshooting

| Issue | Reason | Fix |
|-------|--------|-----|
| **Handshake fails with `HandshakeException`** | The server doesn’t support any of the DH/ECDHE suites we offered (e.g., it only supports RSA‑key‑exchange). | Add more suites to `filterDHciphers` or omit the filter to let the server pick any suite (you’ll then not get DH parameters). |
| **`NoSuchFieldException: keyExchange`** | Running on a non‑Oracle JDK (e.g., IBM J9) where the internal class names differ. | Switch to OpenJDK/Oracle JDK or use Bouncy Castle’s TLS API for a portable solution. |
