## Quick reference cheat‑sheet

| Check | Weak / Bad | Good |
|-------|------------|------|
| **Classic DH modulus** | `< 1024 bits` (REJECT) | `≥ 2048 bits` (RECOMMENDED) |
| **Classic DH generator** | Non‑standard (e.g., `g = 0`) | Usual `2` or `5` |
| **ECDHE curve** | `sect*`, `brainpoolP160*`, `ansiX9P160*` | `x25519`, `x448`, `secp256r1`, `secp384r1`, `secp521r1` |
| **TLS 1.3** | Only (EC)DHE – make sure the curve is one of the safe groups above. | OK if curve is safe. |
| **Cipher suite** | `TLS_DHE_RSA_WITH_...` but with weak DH **or** `TLS_RSA_WITH_*` (no forward secrecy) | Any `*_ECDHE_*` or TLS 1.3 suite. |

