## 11️⃣ 控制器 (`AuthController.java`)

```java
package com.example.authdemo.controller;

import com.example.authdemo.dto.*;
import com.example.authdemo.entity.User;
import com.example.authdemo.security.JwtUtil;
import com.example.authdemo.service.UserService;
import jakarta.servlet.http.HttpServletRequest;
import jakarta.validation.Valid;
import lombok.RequiredArgsConstructor;
import org.springframework.http.*;
import org.springframework.security.authentication.*;
import org.springframework.security.core.*;
import org.springframework.security.core.context.SecurityContextHolder;
import org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.*;

@RestController
@RequestMapping("/api/auth")
@RequiredArgsConstructor
public class AuthController {

    private final UserService userService;
    private final AuthenticationManager authenticationManager;
    private final JwtUtil jwtUtil;

    /** 1. 注册 */
    @PostMapping("/register")
    public ResponseEntity<String> register(@Valid @RequestBody RegisterRequest req) {
        try {
            User user = userService.register(req);
            return ResponseEntity.ok("User registered successfully: " + user.getUsername());
        } catch (IllegalArgumentException ex) {
            return ResponseEntity.status(HttpStatus.BAD_REQUEST).body("Registration error: " + ex.getMessage());
        }
    }

    /** 2. 登录 → 返回 Bearer token */
    @PostMapping("/login")
    public ResponseEntity<AuthResponse> login(@Valid @RequestBody LoginRequest req) {
        try {
            // 手动执行认证
            UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken authToken =
                    new UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(req.getUsername(), req.getPassword());

            Authentication auth = authenticationManager.authenticate(authToken);
            SecurityContextHolder.getContext().setAuthentication(auth);

            // 生成 JWT
            String jwt = jwtUtil.generateToken(req.getUsername());
            String bearerToken = jwtUtil.getTokenPrefix() + " " + jwt;

            return ResponseEntity.ok(new AuthResponse(bearerToken));
        } catch (BadCredentialsException ex) {
            return ResponseEntity.status(HttpStatus.UNAUTHORIZED)
                    .body(new AuthResponse("Invalid username or password"));
        }
    }

    /** 3. 退出（前端删除本地 token，后端可实现 token 黑名单） */
    @PostMapping("/logout")
    public ResponseEntity<String> logout(HttpServletRequest request) {
        // 这里演示一种“撤销 token”的思路：将 token JTI 写入 Redis/DB 黑名单，随后过滤器检查黑名单。
        // 为简化示例，默认只清除 SecurityContext（对无状态 token 并不真正失效）。
        SecurityContextHolder.clearContext();
        return ResponseEntity.ok("Logged out successfully");
    }
}
```

> **后端真正的 “退出”**  
> - JWT 天生是 *无状态*，服务器没有保存会话状态。要实现强制失效，需要 **Token 黑名单**（如 Redis）或 **短期 Refresh Token + 长期 Access Token** 方案。  
> - 示例里只做了 `SecurityContextHolder.clearContext()`（防止同一请求内部再次使用已经认证的 `Authentication`），但并不阻止已经拿到 token 的客户端继续调用。生产环境请实现**撤销列表**或**Refresh Token** 方案。

