## 3️⃣ 示例实现 ② – 完全 **Java**（JCodec）**（无 native 依赖）

> **适用场景**：对 native 环境有严格限制（如某些嵌入式或受限的企业容器），或者仅需要 *低分辨率、低帧率* 的实验原型。  
> **注意**：JCodec 的 H.264 编码器仍是 **实验性质**，对大分辨率、30+ fps 的实时需求会比较慢，且只支持 **Baseline profile**。

### 3.1 依赖

```xml
<dependency>
    <groupId>org.jcodec</groupId>
    <artifactId>jcodec</artifactId>
    <version>0.2.5</version>
</dependency>
```

### 3.2 核心代码（简化版）

```java
import org.jcodec.api.SequenceEncoder;
import org.jcodec.common.io.NIOUtils;
import org.jcodec.common.io.SeekableByteChannel;
import org.jcodec.common.model.Picture;
import org.jcodec.scale.AWTUtil;

import javax.imageio.ImageIO;
import java.awt.image.BufferedImage;
import java.io.*;
import java.net.Socket;
import java.nio.ByteBuffer;
import java.nio.channels.WritableByteChannel;

public class JCodecImageToH264 {

    private static final String HOST = "127.0.0.1";
    private static final int PORT = 5000;
    private static final int WIDTH = 640;
    private static final int HEIGHT = 480;
    private static final int FPS = 25;

    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {
        try (Socket socket = new Socket(HOST, PORT);
             OutputStream socketOut = new BufferedOutputStream(socket.getOutputStream())) {

            // JCodec 的 SequenceEncoder 需要一个 SeekableByteChannel
            // 为了避免写磁盘，这里包装一个 “内存 + 立即写到底层 socket” 的 Channel
            SeekableByteChannel chan = new SocketWriteChannel(socketOut);
            SequenceEncoder encoder = new SequenceEncoder(chan, Rational.R(FPS, 1));

            // 示例：把本地 10 张图片转成 H.264 流发送
            for (int i = 0; i < 10; i++) {
                BufferedImage img = ImageIO.read(new File("imgs/pic" + i + ".jpg"));
                // (1) Resize 到目标分辨率（JCodec 不会自动缩放）
                BufferedImage resized = new BufferedImage(WIDTH, HEIGHT, BufferedImage.TYPE_3BYTE_BGR);
                resized.getGraphics().drawImage(img, 0, 0, WIDTH, HEIGHT, null);

                // (2) Convert BufferedImage → JCodec Picture (YUV420)
                Picture pic = AWTUtil.fromBufferedImage(resized);
                encoder.encodeNativeFrame(pic);
                // 用 Thread.sleep(40) 模拟 FPS（可省略，取决于实时需求）
                Thread.sleep(1000 / FPS);
            }

            encoder.finish(); // flush 并写 EOS NAL
        }
    }

    /** 一个把 ByteBuffer 写入 Socket OutputStream 的 SeekableByteChannel */
    static class SocketWriteChannel implements SeekableByteChannel {
        private final OutputStream out;
        private long position = 0;
        private boolean open = true;

        SocketWriteChannel(OutputStream out) { this.out = out; }

        @Override public int write(ByteBuffer src) throws IOException {
            int n = src.remaining();
            byte[] buf = new byte[n];
            src.get(buf);
            out.write(buf);
            position += n;
            return n;
        }

        @Override public int read(ByteBuffer dst) throws IOException { throw new UnsupportedOperationException(); }
        @Override public long position() { return position; }
        @Override public SeekableByteChannel position(long newPos) throws IOException { throw new UnsupportedOperationException(); }
        @Override public long size() throws IOException { return position; }
        @Override public SeekableByteChannel truncate(long size) throws IOException { throw new UnsupportedOperationException(); }
        @Override public void close() throws IOException { out.close(); open = false; }
        @Override public boolean isOpen() { return open; }
    }
}
```

**要点**：

- `SequenceEncoder` 自动完成 **RGB → YUV420**、**帧率管理**、**NAL 打包**，只要给它 `Picture` 即可。  
- 为了不写磁盘，我实现了 **`SocketWriteChannel`**（把 `ByteBuffer` 的内容直接写入 `Socket`），这满足 `SeekableByteChannel` 接口的最小需求。  
- `encoder.finish()` 会写入 **H.264 Annex B** 结束码（`0x00000001` + `0x09 0x10`），确保接收端识别流结束。

> **性能提示**：在 JDK 运行时，`AWTUtil.fromBufferedImage`（RGB→YUV）是瓶颈。若需要每秒 30 帧以上，建议改用 **OpenCV + JavaCV**（上面的实现）或 **JNI 调用 x264**。

