#### NettyServer 核心实现

```java
public class NettyServer {

    private final int port;
    private final Resource keyStore;
    private final String keyStorePassword;
    private final H264StreamingService streamingService;

    public NettyServer(int port, Resource keyStore, String password,
                       H264StreamingService streamingService) {
        this.port = port;
        this.keyStore = keyStore;
        this.keyStorePassword = password;
        this.streamingService = streamingService;
    }

    public void start() throws Exception {
        // SSL context (TLS 1.2+)
        SslContext sslCtx = SslContextBuilder.forServer(
                keyStore.getInputStream(),
                password.toCharArray())
                .protocols("TLSv1.2", "TLSv1.3")
                .ciphers(null, SupportedCipherSuiteFilter.INSTANCE)
                .build();

        EventLoopGroup bossGroup = new NioEventLoopGroup(1);
        EventLoopGroup workerGroup = new NioEventLoopGroup();

        ServerBootstrap b = new ServerBootstrap();
        b.group(bossGroup, workerGroup)
         .channel(NioServerSocketChannel.class)
         .childHandler(new ChannelInitializer<SocketChannel>() {
             @Override
             protected void initChannel(SocketChannel ch) {
                 ChannelPipeline p = ch.pipeline();
                 p.addLast(sslCtx.newHandler(ch.alloc()));
                 // 心跳/超时检测
                 p.addLast(new IdleStateHandler(30, 0, 0));
                 // 自定义二进制协议解码（可选，若仅服务端发送则不需要 decode）
                 p.addLast(new LengthFieldBasedFrameDecoder(
                         10 * 1024 * 1024,   // max frame 10 MB
                         0, 4, 0, 4));
                 // 业务处理
                 p.addLast(new H264PushHandler(streamingService));
             }
         });

        ChannelFuture f = b.bind(port).sync();
        System.out.println("Netty TLS server started on port " + port);
        f.channel().closeFuture().sync();
    }
}
```

#### H264PushHandler（把编码数据写到每个已连接的客户端）

```java
public class H264PushHandler extends SimpleChannelInboundHandler<ByteBuf> {

    private final H264StreamingService streamingService;
    private final ScheduledExecutorService scheduler = Executors
            .newSingleThreadScheduledExecutor();

    public H264PushHandler(H264StreamingService streamingService) {
        this.streamingService = streamingService;
    }

    @Override
    public void channelActive(ChannelHandlerContext ctx) {
        // 每 33ms（约 30fps）拉一次 outboundQueue 并写到通道
        scheduler.scheduleAtFixedRate(() -> {
            byte[] packet = streamingService.getOutboundQueue().poll();
            if (packet != null && ctx.channel().isActive()) {
                ByteBuf buf = Unpooled.wrappedBuffer(packet);
                ctx.writeAndFlush(buf);
            }
        }, 0, 33, TimeUnit.MILLISECONDS);
    }

    @Override
    public void channelInactive(ChannelHandlerContext ctx) throws Exception {
        super.channelInactive(ctx);
        scheduler.shutdownNow(); // 客户端下线，停止轮询
    }

    // 如果我们要接受客户端的控制帧（比如鉴权、关闭流）这里实现：
    @Override
    protected void channelRead0(ChannelHandlerContext ctx, ByteBuf msg) throws Exception {
        // 简单演示：第一帧必须是 JWT Token（UTF‑8）
        int len = msg.readableBytes();
        byte[] tokenBytes = new byte[len];
        msg.readBytes(tokenBytes);
        String token = new String(tokenBytes, StandardCharsets.UTF_8);
        // TODO: 校验 token（使用 spring-security jwt）并决定是否继续发送
    }

    @Override
    public void exceptionCaught(ChannelHandlerContext ctx, Throwable cause) {
        cause.printStackTrace();
        ctx.close();
    }
}
```

> **说明**  
> - `LengthFieldBasedFrameDecoder` 用于 **解码** 客户端发送的控制包（如果没有控制包可删掉）。  
> - **发送** 端不需要 decoder，只要把 `packet`（已带 4+8 包头）写入 `ByteBuf` 即可。  
> - **TLS** 已在 `SslContextBuilder` 中完成，所有流量都在 **TLS 1.2/1.3** 之上。  

