### 3.1 服务器端（`ImageReceiverServer.java`）

```java
import java.io.*;
import java.net.*;
import java.nio.file.*;
import java.util.*;

public class ImageReceiverServer {

    // 可配置的安全阈值
    private static final long MAX_IMAGE_SIZE = 10L * 1024 * 1024; // 10 MB
    private static final Path STORAGE_ROOT = Paths.get("uploaded_images");

    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {
        int port = 9000;
        // 若要使用 TLS，请改成 SSLServerSocketFactory 并提供 keystore
        try (ServerSocket server = new ServerSocket(port)) {
            System.out.println("Server listening on :" + port);
            while (true) {
                Socket client = server.accept();
                new Thread(() -> handleClient(client)).start();
            }
        }
    }

    private static void handleClient(Socket socket) {
        System.out.println("Accepted connection from " + socket.getRemoteSocketAddress());
        try (DataInputStream in = new DataInputStream(new BufferedInputStream(socket.getInputStream()))) {
            // 1️⃣ 读取图片数量
            int imageCount = in.readInt();
            if (imageCount <= 0) {
                System.err.println("Invalid imageCount: " + imageCount);
                return;
            }
            System.out.println("Expecting " + imageCount + " images.");

            for (int i = 0; i < imageCount; i++) {
                // 2️⃣ 文件名
                int nameLen = in.readUnsignedShort(); // 2 bytes
                if (nameLen <= 0 || nameLen > 255) { // 简单限制
                    throw new IOException("Invalid filename length: " + nameLen);
                }
                byte[] nameBytes = new byte[nameLen];
                in.readFully(nameBytes);
                String rawFileName = new String(nameBytes, StandardCharsets.UTF_8);
                String safeFileName = sanitizeFileName(rawFileName);
                if (safeFileName == null) {
                    throw new IOException("Unsafe filename: " + rawFileName);
                }

                // 3️⃣ 文件大小
                long fileSize = in.readLong();
                if (fileSize < 0 || fileSize > MAX_IMAGE_SIZE) {
                    throw new IOException("File size out of bounds: " + fileSize);
                }

                // 4️⃣ 接收文件内容
                Path target = STORAGE_ROOT.resolve(safeFileName);
                Files.createDirectories(target.getParent());

                try (OutputStream fileOut = Files.newOutputStream(target, StandardOpenOption.CREATE_NEW)) {
                    long remaining = fileSize;
                    byte[] buffer = new byte[8192];
                    while (remaining > 0) {
                        int toRead = (int) Math.min(buffer.length, remaining);
                        int read = in.read(buffer, 0, toRead);
                        if (read == -1) {
                            throw new EOFException("Unexpected EOF while reading image data");
                        }
                        fileOut.write(buffer, 0, read);
                        remaining -= read;
                    }
                }

                System.out.println("Saved image #" + (i + 1) + " -> " + target);
            }

            System.out.println("All images received successfully.");
        } catch (Exception e) {
            System.err.println("Error handling client: " + e.getMessage());
            e.printStackTrace();
        } finally {
            try {
                socket.close();
            } catch (IOException ignored) {}
        }
    }

    /**
     * 简单的文件名清理：去掉路径分隔符、空字符，只保留 alnum、_、-、.。
     * 如需更严格，可只允许白名单的扩展名（jpg/png）。
     */
    private static String sanitizeFileName(String raw) {
        // 1. 移除目录穿越
        String name = raw.replaceAll("[\\\\/]+", "_");
        // 2. 只保留安全字符
        if (!name.matches("[A-Za-z0-9._-]+")) {
            return null;
        }
        // 3. 防止空文件名
        if (name.isBlank()) {
            return null;
        }
        // 4. 可加上时间戳或 UUID 防止冲突
        return System.currentTimeMillis() + "_" + name;
    }
}
```

#### 关键安全点说明

| 部分 | 安全实现 | 为什么 |
|------|----------|--------|
| `MAX_IMAGE_SIZE` | 限制单张图片最大 10 MB | 防止耗尽磁盘、内存或导致 **DoS** |
| `sanitizeFileName` | 过滤 `../`、非法字符、白名单 | 防止 **路径遍历**、任意文件写入 |
| `Files.createDirectories` + `StandardOpenOption.CREATE_NEW` | 若同名文件已存在则抛异常 | 防止 **覆盖已有文件** |
| `try (DataInputStream)` | 自动关闭流，防止资源泄漏 | 资源管理 |
| `socket.close()` | 确保连接结束 | 防止 **僵尸连接** |

> **若要进阶**：  
> * 用 `SSLSocketFactory` 包装 `ServerSocket` → TLS 加密  
> * 在读取 `imageCount` 之前做 **身份验证**（如发送一个 32‑byte Token 并在服务器端校验）  
