## 5. TL;DR Checklist for a Secure Android TCP‑SSL Client

| ✅ Item | Description |
|------|--------------|
| **Internet permission** | `android.permission.INTERNET` in manifest. |
| **Network‑security‑config** | Prevent clear‑text, optionally pin certificates. |
| **Do not trust all certificates** | Never use a `TrustAllX509TrustManager` in production. |
| **Enforce TLS 1.2+** | Use `setEnabledProtocols` on the socket. |
