| **Hostname verification** | Handled automatically by `SSLSocket.startHandshake()`. |
| **Run off the UI thread** | All I/O must be on a background thread. |
| **Close resources** | Always call `close()` in a `finally` block. |
| **Log only non‑sensitive data** | Never log raw payloads or private keys. |
