            // 3️⃣  Extract only the *text* of an element (alternative approach)
            //    If you need just the text, use XPathConstants.STRING instead of NODESET.
            //    This helper shows how you could extend the method for that case.

        } catch (Exception e) {
            e.printStackTrace();
