## Why the extra security steps matter  

| Threat | What we disabled / configured | How it mitigates the threat |
|--------|------------------------------|-----------------------------|
| **XML External Entity (XXE)** | `http://apache.org/xml/features/disallow-doctype-decl`, `external-general-entities`, `external-parameter-entities` | Prevents the parser from loading external files/URLs defined in `<!DOCTYPE …>` or `&entity;` declarations. |
