## 3️⃣ Security‑researcher checklist – *Why the changes matter*

| # | What you changed | Security impact |
|---|------------------|-----------------|
| **1** | Replaced smart quotes with plain ASCII (`"`). | Prevents build failures – a broken build can lead to “run‑in‑debug‑mode” shortcuts that expose internal endpoints. |
| **2** | Moved the error controller into its own, properly annotated class (`@Controller`). | Guarantees the bean is discovered by component scanning and avoids accidental exposure via the default Whitelabel endpoint. |
