| **Authoritative server logic** | Never trust client‑sent positions; validate speed, collisions, and apply physics on the server. |
| **Persistence of live state** | Regularly write player objects to MongoDB (or use Redis for fast in‑memory storage + snapshot). |
| **Skill system** | Store skill definitions in a DB/JSON file, add cooldown timers (`Date.now() - lastCast >= cd`). |
