```js
if (req.user.is_admin || req.user.id == user.id) {
    … // ok
}
ApiError.forbidden('Нет доступа')
```

`ApiError.forbidden` likely sends a **403** but you never stop execution, so the function falls out of the `try` block without ever sending a response. Add `return` (or `throw`) so the request ends early.

