```js
catch {
    ApiError.internal('Не удалось обновить пользователя.')
}
```

You lose the original error (`err`) and the stack trace, making debugging impossible. Always log the error (or forward it to your error‑tracking system) and optionally include a debug flag.

```js
catch (err) {
