| `catch (err)` with logging | You now see the actual stack trace in your logs / monitoring system. |
| Use of the nullish coalescing operator (`??`) | Keeps existing values when the payload does not contain a new one. |
| Removed `password: user.password` from the update payload (it is unnecessary and potentially dangerous). | Keeps the password untouched. |

