# JWT secret – use a strong, random 256‑bit base64 string.
JWT_SECRET=YOUR_SUPER_SECRET_256BIT_BASE64

# Token lifetime (e.g. 1h, 7d)
JWT_EXPIRES_IN=1h

# Optional: restrict CORS to your front‑end domain
CORS_ORIGIN=https://myfrontend.example.com
```

Generate a good secret, e.g.:

```bash
node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('hex'))"
