## 8️⃣ Next‑Step Enhancements (if you want to harden further)

| Feature | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| **Refresh Tokens** | Issue a short‑lived access token + long‑lived secure HttpOnly refresh token. Store refresh token hash in DB to allow revocation. |
| **Account Lockout** | After `n` failed login attempts, temporarily lock the account (store `failedAttempts` + `lockUntil`). |
| **MFA (TOTP/Email)** | Add a second factor via Google Authenticator or one‑time email code. |
| **Content‑Security‑Policy (CSP)** | Tighten `helmet` CSP configuration to only allow needed sources. |
| **Helmet‑powered HSTS** | Enforce HTTPS strictly (`maxAge: 31536000`). |
| **OpenAPI / Swagger** | Auto‑generate API docs; also useful for audit. |
| **CI/CD Scanning** | Integrate Snyk, Dependabot or GitHub CodeQL. |
| **Static Code Analysis** | Run `npm run lint` with ESLint + security plugins (e.g., `eslint-plugin-security`). |
| **Runtime WAF** | Deploy behind a Web Application Firewall (e.g., Cloudflare, AWS WAF). |
| **Observability** | Export logs to ELK/Datadog, trace requests, instrument with OpenTelemetry. |

