## 📋 What the script checks

| Feature | Why it matters for “latest” support | Detection technique |
|--------|--------------------------------------|----------------------|
| **BigInt** | Arbitrary‑precision integers (ES2020) | `typeof BigInt === 'function'` |
| **Optional chaining (`?.`)** | Safer property access (ES2020) | `eval('({a:{b:1}})?.a?.b')` |
| **Nullish coalescing (`??`)** | Distinguish `null/undefined` from falsy values (ES2020) | `eval('null ?? 1')` |
| **Promise.allSettled** | Full Promise API (ES2020) | `typeof Promise?.allSettled === 'function'` |
| **GlobalThis** | Unified global object (ES2020) | `'globalThis' in window` (or `self` in workers) |
| **Dynamic `import()`** | Native module loading (ES2020) | `eval('import("")')` (caught as SyntaxError) |
| **Top‑level `await`** | Await in modules (ES2022) | `(() => { eval('await Promise.resolve()'); })` |
| **Class fields** | Public/ private class properties (ES2022) | `eval('class C { #x = 1; }')` |
| **ECMAScript modules (`type="module"` support)** | Ability to load `<script type="module">` (ES6+) | `document.createElement('script').type = 'module'` |
| **Intl‑DateTimeFormat options (e.g., `dateStyle`)** | Modern i18n (ECMA‑402 2020) | `new Intl.DateTimeFormat(undefined, { dateStyle: 'short' })` |
| **`URLPattern`** | Advanced URL matching (ES2022) | `typeof URLPattern === 'function'` |
| **`structuredClone`** | Deep cloning without custom serializers (ES2021) | `typeof structuredClone === 'function'` |
| **`WeakRefs`** | Weak reference handling (ES2021) | `typeof WeakRef === 'function'` |
| **`Temporal` (stage‑3, but widely polyfilled)** | Next‑gen date/time API (TC39) | `typeof Temporal === 'object'` (if already present) |
| **`Array.prototype.at`** | Positive/negative indexing (ES2022) | `typeof Array.prototype.at === 'function'` |
| **`Object.hasOwn`** | Safer has‑own check (ES2022) | `typeof Object.hasOwn === 'function'` |
| **`String.prototype.replaceAll`** | Global replace without RegExp (ES2021) | `typeof String.prototype.replaceAll === 'function'` |
| **`Promise.any`** | Resolve with first fulfilled promise (ES2021) | `typeof Promise?.any === 'function'` |

