## 2️⃣  Security‑focused design decisions

| Concern | Mitigation in the code |
|---------|------------------------|
| **Cross‑Site Scripting (XSS)** | All user‑provided data (the date) is never inserted into the DOM as raw HTML – we use `textContent` (or `innerText`) which automatically escapes any characters. |
