| **Denial‑of‑Service (DoS) via heavy loops** | The age algorithm is O(1) – simple arithmetic – no long‑running loops that could be abused. |
| **No external dependencies** | No CDN libraries (jQuery, etc.) – reduces supply‑chain risk. |
| **Graceful degradation** | If JavaScript is disabled, the form shows a static message instructing the user to enable JS. |
