| **Graceful shutdown / unhandled rejections** | Not covered. | Node may stay up in a half‑broken state on uncaught errors. |
| **Logging** | Only console output. | Hard to audit, no structured logs, no request IDs. |
| **CORS** | `app.use(cors());` – open to the world. | If you only need specific origins you’re unnecessarily exposing the endpoint. |
