| **Rate‑limit per IP** | `express-rate-limit` to cap calls (e.g., 60 req/min). |
| **Security headers** | `helmet` (auto‑adds CSP, HSTS, X‑Frame‑Options, etc.). |
| **Limited CORS** | Whitelist only trusted origins (env‑driven). |
| **Axios instance with defaults** | Centralised `axios.create()`; API key never re‑created. |
| **Concurrency throttling** | Use `p-limit` (or native `async` queue) to cap parallel outbound calls (e.g., 5). |
| **Result‑level resiliency** | `Promise.allSettled` (or `all` with `catch` per‑promise) so one bad city doesn’t kill the whole batch. |
