|-----|--------------|
| `parentDiv.innerHTML = "You bet on …"` | `textContent` via a `<p>` element (`setStatus`). |
| `setAttribute('onclick', 'handleButtonClick()')` | Plain DOM node (`startBtn`) + delegated click handling (`if (target.id === 'startRaceBtn')`). |
| Direct `redRadio.checked` without null checks | Null‑guard + early exit. |
| Implicit global `purse` | Declared with `let` at top‑level (or stored in a module). |
| Multiple listeners on each radio | Single listener on ancestor (`#betting`). |
| Inline JS → XSS surface | No inline strings, all functions are real code objects. |

