## 6️⃣ Security & Hardening Checklist (as a **Security Researcher**)

| # | Concern | Mitigation in this repo | Remarks |
|---|----------|--------------------------|---------|
| 1️⃣ | **Injection (NoSQL/SQL)** | Mongoose automatically escapes values; we only ever pass **plain objects** to queries. | Avoid constructing query strings manually. |
| 2️⃣ | **Input Validation** | `express-validator` validates & sanitises email & name. | Regular expression for email is modest; can be replaced by a stricter whitelist if needed. |
| 3️⃣ | **Duplicate Subscriptions** | `email` field is unique + upsert logic → **idempotent** endpoint. | Prevents DoS by forcing the DB to store a single doc per address. |
| 4️⃣ | **Rate‑Limiting** | `express-rate-limit` caps requests per IP (default 20/min). | Tune per environment; consider captcha for high‑risk services. |
| 5️⃣ | **Transport Security** | Not in code – you must serve via **HTTPS** (e.g., behind Nginx or using `letsencrypt`). | `helmet` adds HSTS header (`Strict-Transport-Security`) when running under HTTPS. |
| 6️⃣ | **CORS** | `cors()` middleware (defaults to `*`). In production, restrict `origin` to your domain. | `app.use(cors({ origin: 'https://my‑frontend.com' }))`. |
| 7️⃣ | **Error Information Leakage** | Generic 500 messages, internal errors logged only to server console. | Do **not** expose stack traces to clients. |
| 8️⃣ | **Sensitive Config** | All secrets in `.env`; **never** commit. Use a secrets manager (Vault, AWS Parameter Store) in prod. | |
| 9️⃣ | **Logging & Auditing** | Basic `console.info/error`. In a real deployment, pipe to structured log aggregation (ELK, Graylog). | |
| 🔟 | **Data Retention & GDPR** | Simple schema, no personal data beyond email/name. Provide a **DELETE** endpoint if you need to honor “right to be forgotten”. | Add e.g., `DELETE /api/newsletter/:email`. |

---

## 7️⃣ How to Test

```bash
# Successful subscription
curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/newsletter \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"email":"alice@example.com","name":"Alice"}'

