## 7. Full picture – How it all fits together

```
+-------------------+          HTTP POST          +--------------------+
|   Browser (Game) | -------------------------> |  Express server    |
|   askForName()   |   {name, score} (JSON)      |  /api/score        |
|   fetch('/api/…')| <-------------------------- |  returns top‑list  |
+-------------------+           JSON reply        +--------------------+

Server → validate → sanitise → lock → append → read → sort → json → reply
```

The **client** only ever receives **JSON**, never raw file contents – this eliminates path‑traversal or other file‑inclusion attacks.

