## 3️⃣ Designing a Tiny API – “Task‑Manager” Example  

| Resource | URL (base) | Typical actions |
|----------|------------|-----------------|
| **Task** | `/api/v1/tasks` | `GET /tasks` (list) <br> `POST /tasks` (create) |
| **Task (single)** | `/api/v1/tasks/{id}` | `GET /tasks/7` (read) <br> `PUT /tasks/7` (replace) <br> `PATCH /tasks/7` (partial update) <br> `DELETE /tasks/7` (remove) |

*Notice:*  
* URLs are **nouns** (no verbs).  
* Version is part of the path (`v1`) so you can evolve the contract later.  

