| Issue in the original page | Fix / improvement |
|----------------------------|-------------------|
| **Two `socket.onmessage` assignments** – the latter overwrote the first and broke text‑only handling. | Use a **single `addEventListener('message', …)`** that distinguishes text (`string`) from binary (`ArrayBuffer`). |
