| **File size limit only server‑side** – users could try to upload GB‑sized files before the request is aborted. | Added a **client‑side size guard** (`MAX_CLIENT_SIZE = 5 MiB`) with a friendly alert. |
| **`readonly` missing on textarea** – users could accidentally edit chat history. | Set `readonly` attribute so the chat log can’t be tampered with. |

