## 4️⃣ Quick checklist you should run **before putting this live**

| ✔️ | Item |
|----|------|
| **HTTPS** | Serve the whole site over TLS. If you’re on HTTP, cookies (including the session cookie) are sent in clear‑text. |
| **SameSite cookie** | Set `session.cookie_samesite = "Strict"` (or `"Lax"`). |
| **Content‑Security‑Policy** | Add a CSP header to mitigate XSS. Example: `header("Content‑Security‑Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'");` |
| **X‑Frame‑Options** | `header('X‑Frame‑Options: SAMEORIGIN');` to stop click‑jacking. |
| **Rate limiting / captcha** | Prevent credential‑stuffing & brute‑force on the registration endpoint. |
| **Email verification** | Store a `verified` flag / send a confirmation link – otherwise anyone can register with any e‑mail. |
| **Password policy** | Enforce minimum length, complexity, or use a library like `zxcvbn` on the client side. |
| **Logging & monitoring** | Keep an audit trail of registration attempts (especially failures). |
| **Backup** | Regularly backup `input` DB and test restores. |
| **Server hardening** | Disable `root` remote login, use a limited MySQL user (`admin` should only have `INSERT`/`SELECT` on `students`). |

