## 1. Directory layout  

```
/var/www/html/
│
├─ public/
│   ├─ index.html          ← UI (HTML form)
│   └─ write.php           ← PHP handler
│
└─ data/                    ← Where the text files live (outside public webroot)
    └─ .htaccess           ← (optional) deny direct access
```

*`data/`* is **outside** the publicly reachable document root (or at least protected with an `.htaccess` deny rule). This prevents an attacker from downloading the files directly.

