## 1. Architecture générale  

```
+-------------------+               +-------------------+
|   Serveur web     |  PHP script   |   MySQL Server    |
|  (Apache/Nginx)  |  ---------->  |  (localhost)      |
|  backup.php       |               |                   |
+-------------------+               +-------------------+
